%SIXMD 1
# @?ECHO - PRINT ARGUMENTS

## DESCRIPTION

PRINTS ARGUMENTS SEPARATED BY SPACES AND TERMINATES THE LINE.

USAGE IS 'ECHO [ARG ...]'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/ECHO
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/ECHO.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

